  "scope": "Owner rejects floaty/slow direct steering and thin demo. Recreate the supplied/original Balloon Duel mechanical feel: press-edge impulses, fixed30Hz momentum, soft caps, wrap, bounces, live body contact, rebound/pop and original-style powered equipment. Shared engine for solo/2P/multiple-enemy campaign/training with replayable stages/checkpoints; preserve earned shared purchases, six cast and independent outfits/powers, unknown save fields, and child-safe recovery. Replace arbitrary floating Opera launcher with the existing painted left elevator entrance. Up to50 distinct measured physics variants with original-source trace comparison, actual complete bouts and extensive final UI/save/input/visual stress. Final default uses original numeric values, including pop rebound2.0. Explicit90-second friendly rests retain partial enemy stocks and earned purchases without inventing campaign wins. Five native item-fit rejections were corrected with non-destructive socket/scale changes; only Cast.attachment changed. The requested50-total iteration cap was exceeded: two50-setting passes produced75unique parameter sets, recorded honestly; future revalidation now locks its existing design bank.",
